d Tumors With a Specific KRAS Mutation (CodeBreaK 100) [20]. \n\nClinvar records found\n\nClinvar title: NM_004985.5(KRAS):c.36T>C (p.Gly12=) [10]. Clinvar title: NM_004985.5(KRAS):c.337C>T (p.Leu113=) [13]. Clinvar title: NM_033360.4(KRAS):c.524A>G (p.Glu175Gly) [16]. Clinvar title: NM_004985.5(KRAS):c.417T>A (p.Ile139=) [19]. \n\nNote: one further clinvar record was found for this question and is not covered in the summary above"
